Upstream projects and assets
----------------------------

1. ClashGo
   https://github.com/Chen-L-eon/ClashGo
   Original Android application. This project is a Flutter reimplementation of
   its feature set and uses its brand identity, application icon and UI design
   inspiration. ClashGo is licensed under GPL-3.0.

2. Mishka
   https://github.com/YuKongA/Mishka
   Design reference credited by the original ClashGo project.

3. mihomo
   https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo
   Proxy core bundled for Windows as core/mihomo.exe (v1.19.33), together with
   GeoIP/GeoSite data files under core/geodata/. mihomo is licensed under
   GPL-3.0. Its source code is available from the upstream repository.

4. Flutter and Dart packages
   This application is built with Flutter (BSD-3-Clause) and the packages
   listed in pubspec.yaml / pubspec.lock, each distributed under its own
   license. License texts for these packages are available from their
   respective repositories and are included in the Flutter build output.

